[E-TYPE-MISMATCH] Error: type mismatch
    ╭─[ reject/partial-filter.sw:13:82 ]
    │
 13 │ def trivialOnes (numbers: List Nat): {Partial} (List Nat) := List.filter numbers isTrivial
    │                                                                                  ────┬────  
    │                                                                                      ╰────── expected `Nat → Bool`, but this has type `Nat → {Partial} Bool`
    │ 
    │ Note: `List.filter` doesn't take partial callbacks yet: its callback has the type `Nat → Bool`, which must finish, and `isTrivial` is partial (so far only `List.map`'s callback may be partial)
